        <mxCell id="scenarios" value="시나리오 매핑(7.2~7.5절)&lt;br&gt;A) 충돌우선해제: crash_status=CONFIRMED → SWA-07 DECIDE(RELEASE), 하위 tier 결과 무시(SAFETY-REQ-0001/0002)&lt;br&gt;B) 접근위험잠금: SWA-07 ABSTAIN, SWA-08 DECIDE(LOCK)(SAFETY-REQ-0003/0004/0005)&lt;br&gt;C) 센서고장: SWA-09가 SWA-11 직전값으로 DECIDE + SWA-12가 FAULT 산출(SAFETY-REQ-0008/0009)&lt;br&gt;D) 게이팅: SWA-03/04에서 INVALID/STALE 판정 시 해당 Rule ABSTAIN(SAFETY-REQ-0006/0007)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1020" width="1300" height="140" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer2" value="교육용 샘플 | © 2026 Synetics | 과정 밖 이용은 사전 서면 승인 필요 | 설계 초안 지원용, 공식 인증/심사 판정 아님" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1190" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>

  <diagram id="state-transition" name="Page 3 - 상태 전이">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1300" pageHeight="800" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>

        <mxCell id="title3" value="ENG-SWE2-002 Page 3 — 시스템 상태 전이 (8장, SWA-12 SystemStateManager 소유)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="10" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="stNominal" value="NOMINAL" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="300" width="160" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stDegraded" value="DEGRADED" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="300" width="160" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stFault" value="FAULT" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE5D6;strokeColor=#C00000;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="300" width="160" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="t1" value="안전 관련 필수 입력 200ms 초과 미갱신&#xa;→ 100ms 이내 (SAFETY-REQ-0006)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stNominal" target="stDegraded"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2" value="SensorFaultSignal.asserted=TRUE&#xa;(SAFETY-REQ-0009)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stDegraded" target="stFault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t3" value="SensorFaultSignal.asserted=TRUE&#xa;(SAFETY-REQ-0009, 동시충족 시 FAULT 우선 가정)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stNominal" target="stFault"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-60" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="600" y="200"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="t4" value="확인 필요: 복귀 조건 미정의" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#C00000;fontColor=#C00000;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stDegraded" target="stNominal"><mxGeometry x="0" y="60" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="640" y="470"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t5" value="확인 필요: 복귀 조건 미정의" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#C00000;fontColor=#C00000;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stFault" target="stNominal"><mxGeometry x="0" y="90" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1080" y="500"/><mxPoint x="200" y="500"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="notes" value="비고&lt;br&gt;- 처리기한: NOMINAL→DEGRADED는 200ms 초과 시점부터 100ms 이내(SAFETY-REQ-0006)&lt;br&gt;- FAULT는 SAFETY-REQ-0009에 따라 첫 평가주기부터 산출(별도 처리기한 미명시)&lt;br&gt;- DEGRADED/FAULT 동시 충족 시 우선순위, 복귀(DEGRADED→NOMINAL, FAULT→NOMINAL) 조건은 OEM 미정의 — 확인 필요 사항(15장)&lt;br&gt;- 금지 전이: 위에 정의되지 않은 전이는 Phase1 구현에 포함하지 않음&lt;br&gt;- 미정의 전이 로직은 SWA-12 내부에만 위치 — 향후 확정 시 SWA-12만 수정" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="520" width="1040" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer3" value="교육용 샘플 | © 2026 Synetics | 과정 밖 이용은 사전 서면 승인 필요 | 설계 초안 지원용, 공식 인증/심사 판정 아님" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="720" width="1040" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
